Lab 7: System Registration with Subscription Manager
Objectives
By the end of this lab, you will be able to:

Understand the purpose and benefits of Red Hat Satellite for system management
Register RHEL hosts to Satellite using subscription-manager command-line tool
Create and apply activation keys for automated system registration
Validate successful registration through the Satellite web dashboard
Troubleshoot common registration issues and verify system connectivity
