Before starting this lab, you should have:

Basic understanding of Linux command-line operations
Familiarity with Red Hat Enterprise Linux (RHEL) system administration
Knowledge of package management concepts
Understanding of network connectivity and DNS resolution
Access to root or sudo privileges on target systems
