Lifecycle Environment: Should show correct environment
Subtask 4.3: Review Subscription Details
Examine subscription and repository information for the registered host.

Click on Subscriptions tab for the host

Verify attached subscriptions:

Check subscription names and quantities
Confirm expiration dates
Review subscription status
Navigate to Repository Sets tab:

Verify enabled repositories
Check repository synchronization status
Review Packages tab:

View installed packages
Check for available updates
Subtask 4.4: Test Remote Management
Verify that Satellite can manage the registered system remotely.

Navigate to Hosts > All Hosts

Select your registered host

Click Actions dropdown and test:

Run Job: Execute a simple command like uptime
Package Actions: Install or update a package
Reboot Host: Schedule a system reboot
Monitor job execution in Monitor > Jobs

Troubleshooting Common Issues
Registration Failures
If registration fails, check these common issues:

Certificate problems:
sudo rm -f /etc/rhsm/ca/katello-server-ca.pem
sudo wget -O /etc/rhsm/ca/katello-server-ca.pem \
  https://satellite.example.com/pub/katello-server-ca.pem
Network connectivity:
curl -k https://satellite.example.com/rhsm/consumers
Clean previous registration:
sudo subscription-manager clean
sudo rm -f /etc/pki/consumer/*.pem
Subscription Issues
For subscription-related problems:

Refresh subscription data:
sudo subscription-manager refresh
Check subscription status:
sudo subscription-manager status
Re-attach subscriptions:
sudo subscription-manager attach --auto
Repository Problems
If repositories are not working:

Clear yum cache:
sudo yum clean all
Regenerate repository configuration:
sudo subscription-manager repos --list-enabled
Test repository access:
sudo yum repolist
Verification Commands
Use these commands to verify successful registration:

# Check registration status
sudo subscription-manager status

# Verify identity
sudo subscription-manager identity

# List consumed subscriptions
sudo subscription-manager list --consumed

# Check enabled repositories
sudo subscription-manager repos --list-enabled

# Test repository access
sudo yum repolist enabled

# Verify katello-agent
sudo systemctl status goferd

# Check last communication with Satellite
sudo katello-package-upload
